   21. Active HCV infected subjects (HCV antibody positive and HCV-RNA level higher than the detection limit)
   22. Those who have a history of abuse of psychotropic substances and are unable to give up or have mental disorders;
   23. Inoculate the live vaccine within 30 days before the first administration; Note: it is allowed to receive the injection inactivated virus vaccine for seasonal influenza; however, it is not allowed to accept the live attenuated influenza vaccine for intranasal medication.

   There are medical history, disease, treatment or laboratory abnormal results that may interfere with the test results, prevent the subjects from participating in the whole process of the study, or the researchers think that participating in the study is not in the best interests of the subjects.

NCT04131153.eligibility_criteria:
